274
00:13:07,100 --> 00:13:14,720
We aren't getting much done at this point.

275
00:13:16,220 --> 00:13:18,220
All right, time for a break.

276
00:13:18,220 --> 00:13:27,640
It sucks not having time off, but the big battle's coming up and we gotta be ready for it.

277
00:13:28,580 --> 00:13:32,160
The kingdom needs us to protect it, so I'm honored to fight.

278
00:13:32,760 --> 00:13:35,360
Captain, feel free to push us even harder.

279
00:13:36,280 --> 00:13:39,280
I'm planning on it, but try not to injure yourselves.

280
00:13:39,960 --> 00:13:40,380
Right!

281
00:13:41,160 --> 00:13:43,100
I'm happy they're so enthusiastic.

282
00:13:43,360 --> 00:13:47,140
It's probably because I eased the restrictions on fraternizing with men.

283
00:13:48,220 --> 00:13:52,460
Once we take care of this situation with the spade kingdom, I'm gonna spend so much time with my boyfriend.

284
00:13:53,880 --> 00:13:56,320
Yeah, I wanna go on a date with my guy every day.

285
00:13:56,440 --> 00:13:58,140
That's why we gotta get stronger and quick.

286
00:13:58,780 --> 00:13:59,440
No fear!

287
00:13:59,640 --> 00:14:01,380
My boyfriend and I just got a quit.

288
00:14:01,580 --> 00:14:01,860
What?

289
00:14:02,160 --> 00:14:03,460
Which one of you broke it off?

290
00:14:04,000 --> 00:14:05,100
It was his choice.

291
00:14:05,920 --> 00:14:06,920
That's too bad.

292
00:14:07,040 --> 00:14:08,880
You have both been really busy lately, though.

293
00:14:09,220 --> 00:14:10,300
I'm so sorry.

294
00:14:10,520 --> 00:14:13,220
But hey, the best thing to do is get on the rebound.

295
00:14:13,760 --> 00:14:14,660
Oh yeah, true.

296
00:14:14,920 --> 00:14:17,940
Come out drinking with us and I'll set you up with one of my boyfriend's pals.

297
00:14:18,220 --> 00:14:21,960
Well, regardless of the motive, I do appreciate their gusto.

298
00:14:22,420 --> 00:14:23,940
I'll have to guide them carefully.

299
00:14:24,900 --> 00:14:28,160
Come on, you guys are getting all giddy about romance again? Seriously?

300
00:14:28,780 --> 00:14:30,960
What is so exciting about men anyway?

301
00:14:31,360 --> 00:14:32,740
Don't forget Captain Charlotte.

302
00:14:33,160 --> 00:14:35,380
Maybe she'll go on a date with Captain Yamia!

303
00:14:36,460 --> 00:14:38,080
Is everything okay, ma'am?

304
00:14:38,720 --> 00:14:39,620
Uh, yes.

305
00:14:39,840 --> 00:14:40,420
I'm alright.

306
00:14:40,980 --> 00:14:43,900
Speaking of which, have there been any developments between you two?

307
00:14:44,840 --> 00:14:46,420
I don't understand what you mean.

308
00:14:46,640 --> 00:14:50,520
Your sweet, budding romance with a hunkster who heads up the Black Bulls, obviously.

309
00:14:52,160 --> 00:14:55,740
Did you guys go on any more dates after you had such a good time at the Mixer?

310
00:14:56,060 --> 00:14:56,980
The Mixer?

311
00:14:56,980 --> 00:15:03,780
That was a wonderful night, wasn't it?

312
00:15:04,000 --> 00:15:06,620
Just one more push and he would have been all hers.

313
00:15:06,860 --> 00:15:08,080
Absolutely ridiculous.

314
00:15:08,360 --> 00:15:09,380
Not at all, ma'am.

315
00:15:09,480 --> 00:15:10,980
You are headed in the right direction.

316
00:15:11,360 --> 00:15:11,860
Trust us.

317
00:15:11,980 --> 00:15:14,560
And that's coming from Pooley Angel, the romance expert.

318
00:15:14,820 --> 00:15:16,000
So you know it's legit.

319
00:15:16,420 --> 00:15:17,020
That's right.

320
00:15:17,980 --> 00:15:19,280
Is that really true?

321
00:15:19,780 --> 00:15:21,060
Give us the hot goss.

322
00:15:21,180 --> 00:15:22,700
Are you guys together yet or what?

323
00:15:22,700 --> 00:15:24,500
Of course we're not.

324
00:15:24,600 --> 00:15:24,980
Drop it.

325
00:15:25,100 --> 00:15:25,440
What?

326
00:15:27,020 --> 00:15:32,460
So if I'm being honest, after the last captain's meeting, I was planning to give him a gift

327
00:15:32,460 --> 00:15:33,520
and ask him to dinner.

328
00:15:34,220 --> 00:15:35,580
But I couldn't do it.

329
00:15:36,920 --> 00:15:40,040
Please, Char would never be arm candy for some dumb, stinky man.

330
00:15:40,140 --> 00:15:41,380
She's way too cool for that.

331
00:15:41,880 --> 00:15:43,540
We have a battle to train for.

332
00:15:43,680 --> 00:15:45,200
That needs to be our focus now.

333
00:15:45,480 --> 00:15:46,320
No, no, no.

334
00:15:46,500 --> 00:15:48,160
This is the best moment to strike.

335
00:15:48,160 --> 00:15:50,200
Think about it.

336
00:15:50,500 --> 00:15:52,720
Everybody's on edge because of the fight with Spade.

337
00:15:53,020 --> 00:15:56,260
Which is why all of us could use a little extra love in our lives.

338
00:15:56,500 --> 00:15:57,260
Yeah, exactly.

339
00:15:57,780 --> 00:16:02,440
I know I said I was itching to go on a lot of dates, but the truth is, I already do that

340
00:16:02,440 --> 00:16:02,840
now.

341
00:16:03,280 --> 00:16:07,220
I can't see my boyfriend, but we chat every night with magic communication items.

342
00:16:07,680 --> 00:16:08,700
Wow, that's gross.

343
00:16:09,060 --> 00:16:11,320
This is a once-in-a-lifetime chance for you.

344
00:16:11,840 --> 00:16:13,120
What are you saying?

345
00:16:13,280 --> 00:16:16,020
Impending doom never fails to bring lovers together.

346
00:16:16,020 --> 00:16:19,620
Butting heads with the Spade Kingdom while facing the threat of a devil is just what

347
00:16:19,620 --> 00:16:21,220
the doctor ordered for your love life.

348
00:16:21,580 --> 00:16:23,160
You can't be serious.

349
00:16:23,660 --> 00:16:26,060
Trust me, this is your golden window of opportunity.

350
00:16:26,560 --> 00:16:27,760
Don't let it slip by.

351
00:16:30,480 --> 00:16:32,640
I can't be rescued by a man.

352
00:16:32,860 --> 00:16:34,600
Such a thing is against my principles.

353
00:16:35,060 --> 00:16:36,520
What are you talking about, woman?

354
00:16:36,700 --> 00:16:38,280
You save my butt all the time.

355
00:16:39,440 --> 00:16:41,200
I'm madly in love with you.

356
00:16:41,760 --> 00:16:43,860
That's what's kept me going from the beginning.

357
00:16:44,960 --> 00:16:45,480
Oyami.

358
00:16:46,020 --> 00:16:52,420
Please, Charlotte, will you marry me and have my babies?

359
00:16:53,660 --> 00:16:54,220
Yes.

360
00:16:55,280 --> 00:16:57,320
Then you live happily ever after.

361
00:16:57,880 --> 00:16:58,680
Just a minute.

362
00:16:59,180 --> 00:17:00,700
None of those things is happening.

363
00:17:00,880 --> 00:17:02,220
But what if they did?

364
00:17:02,480 --> 00:17:07,580
If we don't shape up, forget the excitement of impending doom, we'll all be dead.

365
00:17:08,020 --> 00:17:09,640
That's why we need to train harder.

366
00:17:09,640 --> 00:17:12,860
I believe that we've rested long enough, ladies.

367
00:17:13,460 --> 00:17:15,080
Captain Charlotte's amazing.

368
00:17:15,480 --> 00:17:17,440
She doesn't let romance get in her way.

369
00:17:17,440 --> 00:17:20,400
We should work hard and get this danger behind us.

370
00:17:21,400 --> 00:17:24,920
Now Sol, Puli, Selina, Galgaria.

371
00:17:25,720 --> 00:17:27,080
Attack me all at once.

372
00:17:27,080 --> 00:17:29,700
We'll give it everything we've got, Char.

373
00:17:30,300 --> 00:17:31,740
Stone creation magic.

374
00:17:32,100 --> 00:17:33,180
Stone reigns.

375
00:17:33,600 --> 00:17:34,940
Water creation magic.

376
00:17:35,200 --> 00:17:36,540
Cascade destroyer.

377
00:17:40,540 --> 00:17:43,560
Earth magic.

378
00:17:44,100 --> 00:17:45,100
Mud wall partition.

379
00:17:45,100 --> 00:18:04,260
The way Captain Charlotte fights is really elegant.

380
00:18:04,640 --> 00:18:07,140
It's no wonder Captain Yami's so in love with her.

381
00:18:07,140 --> 00:18:08,840
What the?

382
00:18:13,280 --> 00:18:16,320
Oh man, I totally thought I had a chance for a second there.

383
00:18:16,640 --> 00:18:19,020
It's like she planned for everything we threw at her.

384
00:18:19,520 --> 00:18:21,600
She's so good that it's kind of terrifying.

385
00:18:21,900 --> 00:18:23,960
We'd better try not to hold her back.

386
00:18:27,460 --> 00:18:29,840
The four of you take a moment to rest up.

387
00:18:30,080 --> 00:18:31,700
Everyone else, it's your turn.

388
00:18:34,620 --> 00:18:35,940
What do you guys think?

389
00:18:36,520 --> 00:18:36,960
What?

390
00:18:37,140 --> 00:18:38,340
We can't do that.

391
00:18:38,600 --> 00:18:39,620
I support it.

392
00:18:39,920 --> 00:18:41,740
It'd be a good way for us to train.

393
00:18:42,060 --> 00:18:44,140
And we'd be helping Captain Charlotte too.

394
00:18:44,400 --> 00:18:45,440
Two birds, one stone.

395
00:18:45,800 --> 00:18:47,120
I wonder what they're discussing.

396
00:18:47,660 --> 00:18:50,480
Perhaps they're devising a strategy for a combined attack.

397
00:18:51,900 --> 00:18:54,260
Excuse me, Captain, but we have a proposition.

398
00:18:54,940 --> 00:18:55,640
Go ahead.

399
00:18:56,000 --> 00:18:57,440
We're sad to admit this,

400
00:18:57,920 --> 00:19:00,140
but we don't feel like we're worthy training partners

401
00:19:00,140 --> 00:19:01,740
for a powerful mage like you.

402
00:19:02,380 --> 00:19:03,800
Oh no, I wouldn't say that.

403
00:19:04,200 --> 00:19:05,120
It's okay, Captain.

404
00:19:05,120 --> 00:19:06,140
You can be honest.

405
00:19:06,140 --> 00:19:08,360
Even when it's just you against our whole squad,

406
00:19:08,460 --> 00:19:10,400
you beat us every time without breaking a sweat.

407
00:19:10,520 --> 00:19:12,740
Jeez, stop being so pathetic in front of Char.

408
00:19:13,440 --> 00:19:14,920
But she's telling the truth.

409
00:19:15,200 --> 00:19:16,880
That's why we thought it might be more helpful

410
00:19:16,880 --> 00:19:19,180
if we were to train with a different squad instead.

411
00:19:19,680 --> 00:19:20,960
A different squad?

412
00:19:20,960 --> 00:19:22,060
Exactly.

413
00:19:22,340 --> 00:19:23,680
We should pair up with magic knights

414
00:19:23,680 --> 00:19:25,300
who are on the same level as we are.

415
00:19:25,420 --> 00:19:26,720
The black bulls, for example.

416
00:19:26,960 --> 00:19:27,720
Black bulls?

417
00:19:27,800 --> 00:19:30,220
They seem to have a decent mix of the best and the worst,

418
00:19:30,300 --> 00:19:32,740
so I feel our capabilities would balance out well.

419
00:19:33,140 --> 00:19:36,060
Captain, could you please request a joint training session?

420
00:19:37,400 --> 00:19:37,980
Let's see.

421
00:19:38,400 --> 00:19:39,980
I'm not sure whether they'll accept,

422
00:19:40,120 --> 00:19:42,460
but I'll try to find an appropriate moment to ask them.

423
00:19:42,460 --> 00:19:48,400
Captain Charlotte, do you have a minute?

424
00:19:49,120 --> 00:19:49,640
Absolutely.

425
00:19:50,340 --> 00:19:51,760
Sorry to interrupt your work.

426
00:19:52,640 --> 00:19:53,140
Oh, no.

427
00:19:53,280 --> 00:19:56,820
We were just discussing a possible joint training session with the black bulls.

428
00:19:57,220 --> 00:19:58,340
Why, what did you need?

429
00:19:58,780 --> 00:20:00,520
It's about the next captain's meeting.

430
00:20:01,000 --> 00:20:03,420
Is it still safe to assume you're available at that time?

431
00:20:03,900 --> 00:20:04,380
Correct.

432
00:20:05,140 --> 00:20:05,500
Understood.

433
00:20:05,940 --> 00:20:06,800
I'll leave you to it.

434
00:20:07,940 --> 00:20:11,480
Well, we'd better continue as planned for the time being.

435
00:20:11,820 --> 00:20:13,460
We can address that idea later.

436
00:20:13,960 --> 00:20:14,440
Right!

437
00:20:24,260 --> 00:20:26,980
A joint training session with the black bulls.

438
00:20:27,420 --> 00:20:29,040
I wonder if he'll suspect anything.

439
00:20:29,820 --> 00:20:30,080
No.

440
00:20:30,440 --> 00:20:31,740
This is for the good of the kingdom.

441
00:20:31,740 --> 00:20:35,000
We need to be as prepared as possible to face our new enemy.

442
00:20:35,960 --> 00:20:37,160
Hey, quit zoning out.

443
00:20:39,000 --> 00:20:40,180
This is it, Charlotte.

444
00:20:40,660 --> 00:20:42,460
Tell him that our squads should train together.

445
00:20:43,900 --> 00:20:44,200
Huh?

446
00:20:46,060 --> 00:20:47,080
How about that?

447
00:20:47,140 --> 00:20:50,060
Even the prickly princess trips over her own feet sometimes.

448
00:20:50,540 --> 00:20:52,140
I never thought I'd see the day.

449
00:20:52,140 --> 00:21:02,260
She did it again.

450
00:21:02,440 --> 00:21:05,860
If I didn't know any better, I might start to think something was wrong with me.

451
00:21:06,980 --> 00:21:09,160
Everyone's here but the captain of the Blue Rose Knights.

452
00:21:10,160 --> 00:21:11,900
So Charlotte's delayed again.

453
00:21:12,660 --> 00:21:14,580
She and Yami were late to the Star Festival.

454
00:21:15,020 --> 00:21:16,260
What could it be this time?

455
00:21:16,260 --> 00:21:17,960
No idea, sir.

456
00:21:18,540 --> 00:21:22,800
That being said, she did mention that her squad was hoping to train with the black bulls.

457
00:21:23,040 --> 00:21:24,480
I wonder if this could be related.

458
00:21:25,160 --> 00:21:26,520
A joint training session.

459
00:21:27,640 --> 00:21:29,320
Ah, I've just had an idea.

460
00:21:30,820 --> 00:21:35,220
We know the citizens are still terribly exhausted from the Eye of the Midnight Sun's invasion.

461
00:21:36,000 --> 00:21:37,280
There's no denying that.

462
00:21:37,280 --> 00:21:41,440
Surely, they must be worried about whether the royal family can protect them.

463
00:21:42,280 --> 00:21:47,340
It's imperative we restore the public's faith in the magic knights so that everyone feels safe and secure again,

464
00:21:47,860 --> 00:21:50,580
while also improving the morale among the squads.

465
00:21:51,200 --> 00:21:55,460
If we can do that, then we'll be much better prepared to face spade and triumph over the devil.

466
00:21:56,460 --> 00:21:59,240
Sorry, what exactly are you suggesting, sir?

467
00:22:01,640 --> 00:22:04,080
I'm going to have the captains battle each other.

468
00:22:07,280 --> 00:22:37,260
I'm going to have the captains battle each other.

469
00:22:37,280 --> 00:23:07,260
I'm going to have the captains battle each other.

470
00:23:07,260 --> 00:23:09,260
To grab the более prophets together.

471
00:23:09,480 --> 00:23:11,260
I'm going to have to稱� up for the most, otherwise, for two stars.

472
00:23:11,260 --> 00:23:41,240
Black Clover. Page 151. Clash. The Battle of the Magic Knight Squad Captains.

473
00:23:41,260 --> 00:23:43,200
Do your best out there, Captain Yami.

474
00:23:43,320 --> 00:23:45,100
You'll be fine. Want to train again?

475
00:23:45,200 --> 00:23:45,500
No!

476
00:23:46,100 --> 00:23:47,140
All right, all right.

477
00:23:47,420 --> 00:23:48,320
I'm ready to learn.

478
00:23:48,440 --> 00:23:49,100
Which is it?

